  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 512.05 Additional Reporting. A generator that also operates a treatment, storage, or disposal facility at the same location shall submit additional biennial report information as required by Env-Hw 705.03.\n\nSource. #12347, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
